source: https://www.ibm.com/docs/en/SSW0JQG_1.x/apis/apis-overview/budget-api.html
checked: 2026-10-03
method: GET
path: /model/budgets
response fields: code, data, name, id, values, kind, interval, intervalDay, spendLimit, actions, percentage, window, start, end, currentSpend
namespace example: budget-rule-2, namespace kubecost, monthly, intervalDay 1, spendLimit 400, percentage 25, currentSpend 100
cluster example: budget-rule, cluster test, weekly, intervalDay 3, spendLimit 100, percentage 75
window timestamps fill the documented empty strings with RFC3339 placeholders
ids stand in for the generated budget id
not verified against live Kubecost
